MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4df0014cb02a0cf4bbbc7addabd2224a, type: 3}
  m_Name: MainDialogue1NPC
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Wassup homie, you seem lost
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: And...weak, honestly
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: What? Don't give me that face homie, do you even know where you are?
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Bro, you don't even have a weapon! You are in the goddamn Cursed Forest
      and you don't even have a SWORD.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Ugh..here, take this dude.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: This sword is magical, it absorbs certain components to make you stronger.
      Use it right and maybe you'll stop being such a weakling. Now for your lack
      of wits...I'm afraid that's beyond me.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Also, keep an eye out for the purple orbs enemies drop, they might come
      in handy.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: 'Now, there are some slimes over there, weakly bastards but if you touch
      ''em won''t feel nice. Go kill them and absorb their components!!! '
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: 'By the way, "I" opens your inventory and crafting table, "J" uses the
      sword, and mouse interacts with inventory and some other things. '
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Not that I know what this "I", "J" or "mouse" mean or anything I don't
      know why I said that honestly.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Aight good luck!!!
